  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c2f466d8acd888e47941c8dd5566b0bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_SupplyRunnerEli
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::DialogueTree
  startNodeId: root
  nodes:
  - nodeId: root
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "Just got in from the southern run. Vael's patrol moved *again* \u2014
      had to swing forty degrees west to avoid the scan radius. I swear that General
      gets smarter every cycle. You a flier?"
    choices:
    - text: I am, yes.
      nextNodeId: flier_yes
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Not yet.
      nextNodeId: flier_no
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Tell me about Vael's patrol patterns.
      nextNodeId: vael
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: "Signal Dampener \u2014 can you get me one?"
      nextNodeId: dampener
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: flier_yes
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "Good. I need a relief runner for the northern island chain \u2014 I've
      been doing double shifts since Marsh got grounded. Pay is modest but the view's
      incredible."
    choices:
    - text: I'll take the run.
      nextNodeId: run_briefing
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 4
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: eli_quest_accepted
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Not right now.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: flier_no
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: Get a Gyrocopter. Spire's Rest is no place for someone who can't leave
      in a hurry. I can point you at parts if you're building one.
    choices:
    - text: What parts do I need?
      nextNodeId: gyro_parts
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: gyro_parts
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "Rotor Frame, two BasicRotors minimum, a combustion engine, and some glass.
      I've got spare rotors and an engine head in my supply cache \u2014 you can
      have them for the right trade."
    choices:
    - text: Deal.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: run_briefing
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "Three drops \u2014 Outpost Thorn, High Relay, and the Shepherd's Shelf.
      Cargo is already packed. Don't fly through Sector 7 \u2014 Vael has a stationary
      scan unit there."
    choices:
    - text: Got it.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: vael
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "Vael is General THREE \u2014 a sky specialist. Expanded scan radius, rotates
      unpredictably, and she tracks thermal signatures. A Signal Dampener reduces
      how far she detects you. Without one, fly high and fast."
    choices:
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: dampener
    speakerName: Supply Runner Eli
    text: "I've got a schematic. You'll need Copper Plate and a Circuit Board \u2014
      not cheap, but worth every bit. Fits on any vehicle with a utility slot."
    choices:
    - text: Give me the schematic.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
